  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>α</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>β</mi></msqrt></math>, then the value of <math><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></math> is"
  },
